==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
This is one of the easier Zombie Outbreaks in Cats of the Cosmos as Zroco is the only [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemy and even a crowd of Zrocos is still manageable. If you rush this stage, then only a single General GreGory will even have time to spawn. With enough [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]], that General GreGory disappears quickly.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
Make sure to mind the deploy limit of 5. Bring a barrier breaker like [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kitty of Liberty]] or [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Little Leaguer]] to break UltraBaaBaa's barrier. Then use [[:Category:Behemoth Slayer Cats|Behemoth Slayers]] or [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Darks]] like [[Ancient Egg: N103 (Rare Cat)|Gas Mask]] or [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]] to beat [[Ragin' Gory]] and units like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Legs]] to kill the General GreGory. If you can beat it fast enough, the Zory wont spawn, but if you can't, you can bring [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Z-Killers]] if necessary.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
While Deathshund can be threatening, you can simply ignore it. Use strong, cheap attackers like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] to kill the first Wild Doge, then send [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to quickly finish the base off.

